 82    * will be set to otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MAX_FILL_LENGTH - (border size *2).
 83    *
 84    * @param p_title_length The length of the title to verify.
 85    * @param p_border The minimum border length to consider for decoration.
 86    *
 87    * @return The given title size or the calculated maximum size.
 88    */
 89    FUNCTION check_title_size( p_title_length IN INTEGER DEFAULT 0
 90  				, p_border	 IN INTEGER DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_BORDER
 91  				)
