 95    /** FUNCTION otap_string.check_string_size
 96    * Constraints the string size to a value between 80 and 4000. Invalid string size will be set
 97    * to otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MIN_FILL_LENGTH or otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MAX_FILL_LENGTH,
 98    * depending on line size underflow or overflow.
