173    /** PROCEDURE otap_util.validate_config_type
174    * Validates the given configuration. If valid does nothing. If invalid will raise an application
175    * exception. To be used in OTAP_CONFIG triggers. Checks the internal constraints on special configuration values.
176    *
177    * @param p_config_name The configuration name as given, usally :NEW.config_name or :OLD.config_name.
