179    * @param p_config_type The configuration type as given, usally :NEW.config_type or :OLD.config_type. Only CHAR and NUMBER supported.
180    * @param p_translatable The translatable indicator as given, usally :NEW.translatable or :OLD.translatable. Only allowed for CHAR to be set to 1.
181    * @param p_max_length The configuration max length for the config value as given, usally :NEW.config_max_length or :OLD.config_max_length.
182    * @param p_raise By default raise on validation errors, if FALSE deliver default value if available.
183    *
184    * @return The config value as is if tests passed or the default value, if p_raise is FALSE and value not valid.
185    *
186    * @throws -20002 The given config_value is not supported. Empty or only spaces.
187    * @throws -20003 The given config_type is not supported. Only CHAR or NUMBER supported.
188    * @throws -20004 The given config_value exceeds the maximum length allowed.
189    * @throws -20005 The given config_value cannot be converted to a number.
190    */
191    FUNCTION validate_config_value( p_config_name   IN	     VARCHAR2
