354    /** FUNCTION otap_util.build_msg
355    * Builds a message from a template identifier. Fetches the template and fills the given
356    * variables in p_param1-5 with the given value, if the parameters are filled. Type has
357    * special translation handling for filling the @type@ variable, if it exists in the template and
358    * type label is not NULL. Must be a label from otap_identifiers view like LABEL_COLUMN or LABEL_TABLE.
359    *
360    * Leaving all parameters apart from p_cfg_template empty will return just the current translation of
361    * a config or label value, according to OTAP_TRANSLATE or the default.
362    *
363    * Parameters must contain leading and trailing @ variable indicator. Ignored if not a otap variable
364    * in style @varname@.
365    *
366    * @param p_cfg_template The config name of the template. See otap_util.CFG_ constants.
367    * @param p_type_label The label name of the @type@ variable, if needed. See otap_util.CFG_LABEL constants.
368    * @param p_param1 The 1st variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
369    * @param p_param1_value The substitution value for the 1st variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
370    * @param p_param2 The 2nd variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
371    * @param p_param2_value The substitution value for the 2nd variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
372    * @param p_param3 The 3rd variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
373    * @param p_param3_value The substitution value for the 3rd variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
374    * @param p_param4 The 4th variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
375    * @param p_param4_value The substitution value for the 4th variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
376    * @param p_param5 The 5th variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
377    * @param p_param5_value The substitution value for the 5th variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
378    * @param p_param6n The 6th variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional. Supports NULL values.
379    * @param p_param6n_value The substitution value for the 6th variable name. Optional. Supports NULL values.
380    * @param p_description A template overwrite. Will return the given description instead of the template. Optional.
381    * @param p_language_id A valid or existing language id.
382    *
383    * @return The message build from template, overwritten by description or an error message.
