 23    * Validates the basic system of otap, checks if objects are valid, triggers enabled and
 24    * no illegal content in OTAP_TRANSLATE.
 25    *
 26    * Will change the session id to ensure that every user has a unique id within the sequence borders.
 27    *
 28    * @param o_otap_session A valid OTAP_SESSION object to be used for update of session id if not set.
 29    *
 30    * @throws -20099 The otap system is not valid. Ask your admin to fix the system before testing.
 31    */
 32    PROCEDURE validate_otap(o_otap_session IN OUT NOCOPY OTAP_SESSION);
